# Route: guide 40 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 46 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades, Western Plaguelands, Redridge
# Mountains, Moonglade, Tanaris, Silverpine Forest, Loch Modan): Light's Hope
# Chapel -> Corin's Crossing -> Light's Hope Chapel -> Quel'Lithien Lodge ->
# Lake Mereldar -> The Undercroft -> The Bulwark -> Sorrow Hill -> Felstone
# Field -> Gahrron's Withering -> Thondroril River -> Sorrow Hill -> Light's
# Hope Chapel -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Horn of the Beast (3181;
# Margol the Rager 48).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945),
# Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Remember That I Love You (92415), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95189), Bloodied Insignia (95195), Abominable Creatures (95250),
# Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382),
# Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's
# Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), What Comes Around...
# (386), What Comes Around... (386), Songblade Search (95772), Songblade
# Search (95772), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll Temper
# (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The Prophecy of
# Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets (4788), Starving
# Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458).

